        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Wedding dress comprising a bodice, skirt and overskirt in white silk trimmed with ruchings and bows of cream satin ribbon. Long V neckline in front of bodice, bell-shaped sleeves. Piped seams. Plain skirt with a train, and overskirt with pannier drapery. Veil of plain tulle with a ruched edge"@en ;
